WEBVTT

00:09.920 --> 00:18.580
So warm, soft, and smooth...

00:42.080 --> 00:43.420
If...

00:44.210 --> 00:46.830
If I could know that feeling again...

00:53.920 --> 00:54.920
Hiiragi?

00:55.330 --> 00:56.420
Utena Hiiragi!

00:57.500 --> 00:58.670
Y-yes, ma'am!

00:59.040 --> 01:01.040
Is everything alright? You seem distracted.

01:01.040 --> 01:03.380
Ah! S-sorry!

01:03.960 --> 01:05.330
Pay attention, now.

01:05.790 --> 01:06.580
Yes, ma'am!

01:07.210 --> 01:10.040
Wh-what's wrong with my brain?!

01:18.630 --> 01:22.830
Thank God that's over!
And that it was a normal, peaceful day today!

01:22.830 --> 01:25.630
Yeah. Wanna stop by somewhere on our way home?

01:25.960 --> 01:29.880
I can't. I have to help out at home today.

01:30.580 --> 01:34.790
Aw, okay. See you tomorrow, then, Sayo-chan!

01:34.920 --> 01:36.750
Yes, see you then.

01:37.290 --> 01:38.630
Yeah, see ya.

01:44.960 --> 01:45.750
Hiiragi-san.

01:46.040 --> 01:46.630
Yeah?!

01:48.420 --> 01:49.380
Are you okay?

01:49.500 --> 01:50.040
Huh?

01:50.790 --> 01:56.290
You look troubled. If you need to vent,
I'm always happy to lend you an ear.

01:56.630 --> 02:04.000
Oh, I'm okay! But... uh... thanks.

02:04.290 --> 02:05.580
If you're sure.

02:06.040 --> 02:07.210
See you tomorrow.

02:12.290 --> 02:16.380
Wow, Minakami-san's so nice...

03:48.580 --> 03:52.250
<b>Her Name is Magia Baiser!</b>

03:49.630 --> 03:50.540
Hello.

03:51.000 --> 03:56.080
Hi there, Sayo-chan! Helping out again today?

03:56.210 --> 03:56.790
I am.

03:56.960 --> 03:59.170
Aren't you going above and beyond?!

03:59.420 --> 04:02.330
Oh, no, it's just the usual help. I should get started.

04:02.330 --> 04:03.540
Of course!

04:06.670 --> 04:09.040
What a wonderful young lady.

04:13.630 --> 04:19.210
Minakami-san actually talked to me. She's so nice.

04:20.790 --> 04:22.500
The Tres Magia are here to stop you!

04:22.630 --> 04:25.580
Say your prayers, 'cause Magia Azure
is gonna kick your butt!

04:25.580 --> 04:27.130
I'd like to see you try!

04:26.580 --> 04:28.040
I'm Sulphur and I'm gonna kick your butt, too!

04:28.250 --> 04:30.000
I'm Magenta!

04:34.750 --> 04:39.920
I can't believe I was fantasizing about that... 
I have to stop, before I'm too far gone...

04:41.500 --> 04:46.080
I gotta keep it together. Gotta stop doing this.

04:59.460 --> 05:03.630
Please, help me stop doing terrible things
to the Tres Magia.

05:04.920 --> 05:08.750
And... Help me get away from that thing.

05:15.880 --> 05:20.290
Who am I kidding?
The gods aren't gonna get me out of this mess...

05:21.210 --> 05:23.380
I need to do to it myself.

05:28.630 --> 05:31.630
<b>4 hours</b>

05:28.630 --> 05:31.630
<b>of sexy content</b>

05:28.630 --> 05:31.630
<b>inside!</b>

05:43.500 --> 05:45.460
S&M...

05:47.000 --> 05:50.130
This is... totally porn.

05:51.580 --> 05:53.960
What?! No! I'm not gonna read it!

05:53.960 --> 05:55.330
I gotta go home!

06:00.880 --> 06:03.040
<b>SENSEI</b>

06:00.880 --> 06:03.040
<b>SHOWS HER</b>

06:00.880 --> 06:03.040
<b>THE ROPES...</b>

06:24.210 --> 06:24.960
Let's go.

06:47.960 --> 06:49.420
Bondage...

06:51.130 --> 06:52.540
Whipping...

06:54.290 --> 06:56.040
Tickling...

06:57.380 --> 07:02.210
Wait a sec... This is all stuff I've done to the Tres Magia!

07:05.210 --> 07:08.880
And all of it's part of this "BDSM" stuff?

07:09.210 --> 07:12.420
Th-then does that mean...

07:14.630 --> 07:17.380
Deny it all you want, but look how excited you are.

07:18.380 --> 07:21.670
Setting up a trail of porn mags was the right call.

07:23.830 --> 07:25.670
Blindfolds...

07:43.380 --> 07:45.580
Cleaning the temple grounds is so relaxing.

07:47.920 --> 07:51.540
If only every day could be this peaceful.

07:56.000 --> 07:58.290
I suppose it wasn't meant to be...

08:00.540 --> 08:02.790
What?! Why now?!

08:05.920 --> 08:10.290
How?! I didn't even say the magic words!

08:11.960 --> 08:16.830
Perfect. Her lust made her powers
burst out of containment.

08:18.380 --> 08:21.380
Here to cause chaos on holy ground, villain?

08:24.580 --> 08:26.130
Magia Azure!

08:26.500 --> 08:31.130
Prepare yourself, agent of evil.
Today, you're going down.

08:35.330 --> 08:36.080
Say your prayers!

08:38.790 --> 08:41.130
I-I didn't mean to! Promise!

08:46.500 --> 08:47.330
Get back here!

08:52.380 --> 08:54.750
I-I have to do something, or I'm toast!

08:55.290 --> 08:56.790
B-but what?!

08:59.790 --> 09:00.540
Take this!

09:06.880 --> 09:08.380
Wh..what the-?!

09:10.540 --> 09:11.460
Get it off!

09:11.580 --> 09:14.170
Yes! Now's my chance!

09:15.290 --> 09:16.290
C'mon!

09:28.380 --> 09:29.040
C'mon!

09:29.830 --> 09:31.960
Dammit, it won't budge!

09:33.460 --> 09:36.420
Forget seeing her, I can't even sense her!

09:37.750 --> 09:39.920
Where are you?! Show yourself!

09:41.580 --> 09:42.880
I'm right here.

09:47.790 --> 09:48.630
I missed?!

09:51.000 --> 09:53.080
Is that where you thought I was?

09:56.420 --> 09:59.460
It's no use. I can't see anything.

10:00.380 --> 10:01.710
Where could she be?!

10:03.540 --> 10:06.960
Where is she? Where will she attack from?

10:41.960 --> 10:44.290
St-stop...

10:49.670 --> 10:53.000
Now, you don't have any way to fight back.

11:57.630 --> 11:59.750
No! Don't!

12:07.920 --> 12:08.790
What?!

12:10.880 --> 12:13.330
No! Stop!

12:17.290 --> 12:20.540
Stop!

12:44.710 --> 12:47.040
Let's call it here for today.

12:47.710 --> 12:48.710
Next time...

12:51.250 --> 12:54.380
...let's have even more fun.

13:05.790 --> 13:07.080
Azure!

13:07.380 --> 13:09.040
Are you okay, Sayo-chan?!

13:09.880 --> 13:13.830
She must've felt us coming.
That girl makes a fast getaway.

13:17.540 --> 13:19.880
I'm so glad you're okay!

13:20.880 --> 13:24.380
Next time... let's have even more fun.

13:33.000 --> 13:35.250
Damn, nice dom work today.

13:35.250 --> 13:36.880
Could you please not?

13:43.670 --> 13:46.880
I think it's time you came up with a name.

13:48.080 --> 13:49.540
Right now? Why?

13:49.960 --> 13:51.960
Cause it'll make things easier on us.

13:52.420 --> 13:57.670
And every magical girl villain needs the perfect name.

13:58.130 --> 14:08.250
<b>SICK LATIN</b>

13:58.130 --> 14:08.250
<b>WORDS (GLORIA!)</b>

13:58.130 --> 14:08.250
<b>BABY'S FIRST</b>

13:58.130 --> 14:08.250
<b>GERMAN DICTIONARY</b>

13:58.210 --> 13:59.920
So, what kind of name do you want?

14:00.330 --> 14:03.460
Nerdy weirdoes like you are all about
weird German and Latin names, right?

14:04.080 --> 14:05.750
Actually, I don't really care...

14:06.210 --> 14:08.040
Fine, then, I'll pick a name.

14:08.250 --> 14:09.880
Phantom Domme.

14:10.380 --> 14:12.750
Never mind! I'll pick one myself!

14:15.710 --> 14:20.170
Wait, though, when am I gonna be done doing this?

14:20.670 --> 14:23.460
When we defeat the magical girls, duh.

14:23.960 --> 14:26.040
So you can take over the world?

14:26.460 --> 14:29.000
Kind of, but not exactly.

14:29.130 --> 14:29.460
Huh?

14:30.460 --> 14:36.420
I come from a different world,
where all kinds of mascot characters live.

14:37.170 --> 14:38.790
<b>GET OUT!</b>

14:37.250 --> 14:42.290
But everyone hates my kind.
They did everything to oppress us.

14:43.750 --> 14:48.290
Now, they're using the magical girls
as weapons to kill us all!

14:48.830 --> 14:52.460
Wh-wh-what?! The magical girls would never do that!

14:52.790 --> 14:55.500
If you ask me, those girls are being tricked into it.

14:56.210 --> 14:58.330
They got told that we're the "evil" mascots.

14:58.830 --> 15:05.210
That's why I came to Earth:
to find people who can help us stand up and fight.

15:05.460 --> 15:09.670
Then why do you go around
saying you're an evil organization?!

15:09.880 --> 15:11.670
If saving my friends is "evil"...

15:12.250 --> 15:13.960
...then I'm fine playing the villain.

15:15.580 --> 15:18.130
I had no idea...

15:19.540 --> 15:21.130
Too bad I made it all up.

15:22.040 --> 15:25.790
Okay, we need to talk about this new villain!

15:22.830 --> 15:26.210
<b>DYNAMO</b>

15:28.000 --> 15:29.290
Totally agree.

15:29.500 --> 15:32.500
She's been kicking our butts every time, too!

15:32.500 --> 15:33.670
Totally agree.

15:33.670 --> 15:35.420
We gotta do something about her!

15:35.420 --> 15:36.380
Totally agree.

15:36.580 --> 15:39.250
She did terrible stuff to you
the other day, right, Sayo-chan?

15:39.250 --> 15:42.080
Huh?! No, it wasn't that bad...

15:42.880 --> 15:48.790
Ugh, if it wasn't for that protection magic,
we could totally know who she was...

15:48.790 --> 15:52.290
Yeah, but that's what keeps our identities secret, too.

15:53.040 --> 15:54.710
I know, but still.

15:54.880 --> 15:58.500
Next time... let's have even more fun.

15:58.790 --> 16:01.330
"Even more fun"? What's that supposed to mean?!

16:01.880 --> 16:07.710
How exactly is she going to toy with me next time?!

16:02.130 --> 16:08.880
<b>WORKED UP</b>

16:02.130 --> 16:08.880
<b>WORKED UP</b>

16:08.880 --> 16:11.130
<b>WORKED UP</b>

16:08.880 --> 16:11.130
<b>WORKED UP</b>

16:08.880 --> 16:11.130
<b>WORKED UP</b>

16:08.880 --> 16:11.130
<b>WORKED UP</b>

16:10.290 --> 16:11.040
Sayo-chan?

16:11.040 --> 16:11.750
Huh?!

16:11.920 --> 16:15.330
You okay? Did you get hurt in that last fight?

16:15.330 --> 16:17.380
N-no, I'm completely fine!

16:17.790 --> 16:21.000
Cheer up! Will a bite of my parfait help?

16:21.290 --> 16:24.000
I-I said I'm fine! But thanks.

16:25.460 --> 16:27.250
Later, Kaoruko-chan!

16:27.670 --> 16:28.380
Lates.

16:28.960 --> 16:30.580
See you tomorrow!

16:36.170 --> 16:37.000
Right, then...

16:41.830 --> 16:43.630
I sense the magical girls!

16:44.000 --> 16:45.790
You'll help us fight, right, Utena?

16:45.790 --> 16:48.540
Uh... S-sure.

16:53.040 --> 16:54.460
Magia Sulfur?

16:55.250 --> 16:58.500
There aren't any monsters here,
so why is she here all by herself?

16:59.130 --> 17:00.710
Works out great for us.

17:01.040 --> 17:06.170
All her powers are defensive.
Maybe we can talk things out with her?

17:06.960 --> 17:10.040
I've already tried that tons of times.

17:10.920 --> 17:14.130
Okay, Utena, turn this into a monster.

17:14.580 --> 17:15.420
This thing?

17:17.830 --> 17:18.750
About time.

17:24.630 --> 17:29.250
Magia Sulfur. I'll defeat you and put an end to this fight.

17:30.960 --> 17:32.500
The heck does that mean?

17:39.630 --> 17:40.500
Wha...?

17:46.250 --> 17:48.380
Be a good girl and stay still.

17:49.040 --> 17:50.830
What're you plotting?

17:52.750 --> 17:56.750
You're so thin and beautiful.

17:56.750 --> 17:59.380
Okay, so you're a freak.

18:12.250 --> 18:13.040
Stop!

18:18.420 --> 18:25.170
These are special candles.
They melt at a much lower temperature than normal wax.

18:26.290 --> 18:30.960
You know, I wouldn't want to actually hurt you.

18:31.960 --> 18:35.830
Just admit defeat, and I'll stop.

18:36.130 --> 18:37.750
You got a screw loose!

18:39.460 --> 18:42.540
I'll never.... give up!

18:43.500 --> 18:45.330
Is that right?

18:49.420 --> 18:51.630
FLOWER!

18:53.460 --> 18:57.500
I'll just have to beat this lesson into you!

19:09.540 --> 19:10.170
Huh?

19:12.420 --> 19:18.170
I get it now. You use that crop to make monsters.

19:19.080 --> 19:22.710
I was holdin' back to see
what else you had up your sleeve.

19:23.420 --> 19:27.380
But if you think I'll fall for the same trick twice,
you've got something comin'.

19:28.750 --> 19:31.830
Wh-what are those?

19:31.830 --> 19:37.880
I love these big knuckles, but I don't wanna
scare the little girls who look up to us.

19:40.750 --> 19:41.830
So keep this a secret, mmkay?

19:53.580 --> 19:56.170
You are damn good at running away, aren'tcha?

19:58.960 --> 20:02.540
You seriously still think that'll work?

20:03.130 --> 20:04.880
Keep sellin' me short, and you're in for a whooping.

20:11.250 --> 20:13.130
That'll do ya. Bye, now.

20:27.830 --> 20:32.330
See what I mean? You've mastered the art of escape.

20:34.380 --> 20:37.170
But before you run off with your tail
tucked between your legs,

20:38.170 --> 20:39.790
tell me your name.

20:40.920 --> 20:41.710
My name?

20:43.880 --> 20:46.500
My name...

20:47.540 --> 20:51.040
My name is...

20:58.380 --> 20:59.250
Baiser.

21:00.290 --> 21:01.540
Magia Baiser.

21:03.250 --> 21:06.290
I am your worst nemesis.

21:14.290 --> 21:18.000
Magia Baiser... Aren't you fun?

21:31.130 --> 21:33.040
You okay, Utena?

21:33.880 --> 21:36.790
Who knew Sulfur was that tough?

21:37.250 --> 21:39.670
We'll need to think about how to counter her.

21:41.330 --> 21:42.290
Utena?

23:35.960 --> 23:40.830
<b>The Explosive Leopard!</b>
